## Execution note
Sol runs in a worktree cannot write the shared `.git` (outside their sandbox). Commits of the leads' uncommitted items are done by the lead sessions in their own worktrees; merges/moves are done by Sol only if the sandbox probe (CLEAN2P) shows `.git` writes succeed with R = the main checkout; otherwise the coordinator performs the git operations and Sol prepares content.

