codex
The collection drop is accounted for: 530 old test node IDs disappear and 24 appear, giving 7,329 → 6,823; the second layout adds 40 tests, reaching 6,863. Most lost cases collapsed into missing-input skips. Enabling the data root exposes an SF7 collection error, so those tests are not yet retrievable end to end. I’m writing the report with these failures and the verified custody and score counts.

