    12	|---|---|---|
    13	| Inventory | 0.1 | Raw text scripts, words, characters, marks, punctuation and counts |
    14	| Content gate | **0.3** | Mixed-script DROP, unexpected-script HOLD, raw-text length/cell rules before native work |
    15	| Segmentation | **0.9-s5** | S4 measurement and small branch; inclusive length band 0.30–2.00 for every row |
